:: Sydney Temple Pill Atonement Intro
<<endevent>><<effects>><<run statusCheck("Sydney")>><<sydneySchedule>>
<<npc "Sydney">><<person1>>
<<if $templePromised is "Sydney">>
	Jordan looks from you to Sydney, then down to the grey powder. The silence feels heavier than the failed test.
	"The vow between you has been tainted. Not only your service to the temple, but the promise you made before it."
	<br><br>
	Sydney's grip tightens around your hand.
	<<if _sydneyStatus.includes("corrupt")>>
		<<He>> tries to look defiant, but <<his>> eyes stay fixed on Jordan's hands. "So what now?"
	<<else>>
		<<He>> lowers <<his>> head. "Please," <<he>> says, voice small. "Don't make it worse than it has to be."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	Jordan produces a pill from a folded white cloth. It looks harmless, almost ceremonial.
	"Innocence for the mind. Cure for the body. You have tainted your vow and your love. You will accept purity before you are punished."
<<else>>
	Jordan looks down at the grey powder, then back to you. 
	<br><br>
	"Your failure cannot be ignored." <<nnpc_He "Jordan">> pauses, expression softening only slightly. 
    "But your standing in the temple means your atonement should begin with purification, not force."
	<br><br>
	<<nnpc_He "Jordan">> produces a small pill from a folded white cloth.
	"Innocence for the mind. Cure for the body. Swallow it. Purity must come before punishment."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Swallow the pill|Sydney Temple Pill Atonement]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Sydney Temple Pill Atonement
<<effects>>
<<set _templePillBlocked to xchangePillProtectionActive()>><<temple-purity-pill 7>>
<<if !_templePillBlocked and $xchange.pill.innocenceEffect and $xchange.pill.cumcureEffect>>
	The pill dissolves almost as soon as it touches your tongue.
	A cool, pearly numbness spreads behind your eyes, softening each thought before it can fully form.
	<br><br>
	<span class="pink">Your innocence is forced back into place.</span>
	The second effect follows deeper. It twists through your body, seeking out every lewd trace left behind and scouring it away.
	<br><br>
	<<if $templePromised is "Sydney">>
		Sydney catches you before your knees can weaken.
		<<if _sydneyStatus.includes("corrupt")>>
			"Still with me?" <<he>> asks, voice low. <<His>> fingers dig into your arm. "Don't drift off before they even start."
		<<else>>
			"It's okay," <<he>> whispers, though <<his>> voice trembles. "We'll be pure again.
			We'll make our promise mean something again."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		Jordan watches the two of you in silence before nodding. "Your bond is wounded, not severed. Guard it better."
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		Jordan watches until your breathing steadies. "Good. Now the rest of your atonement may begin."
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	The pill dissolves, but the cleansing warmth dies before it can spread. <span class="blue">Your resistance neutralises it, leaving your thoughts and body unchanged.</span>
	<br><br>
	Jordan's expression hardens. "The dose was taken. We will proceed."
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Next|Sydney Temple Punish Intro]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Temple Pill Atonement
<<endevent>><<effects>><<pass 5>>
<<generateConfessor 1>><<person1>><<generateConfessor 2>><<generateConfessor 3>>
<<set _templePillBlocked to xchangePillProtectionActive()>><<temple-purity-pill 7>>
<<if !_templePillBlocked and $xchange.pill.innocenceEffect and $xchange.pill.cumcureEffect>>
	The pill sits cold on your tongue, then dissolves with impossible speed.
	A clean, dizzy warmth slides down your throat and blooms behind your eyes.
	<br><br>
	<span class="pink">Your thoughts soften at the edges.</span>
	Shame, fear, lust, and memory are wrapped in cotton-white silence.
	You can still think, but every thought feels smaller. Quieter. Easier to fold into obedience.
	<br><br>
	Beneath it, another sensation stirs.
	A clinical pull moves deep inside your body, searching for every trace of lewdness left within you.
	The temple's mercy does not spare you from punishment. It prepares you for it.
	<br><br>
	The <<person1>><<monk>> watches until your breathing steadies. "Good. Now we may begin."
<<else>>
	The pill dissolves, but its warmth fades at once. <span class="blue">Your resistance neutralises it, leaving your thoughts and body unchanged.</span>
	<br><br>
	The <<person1>><<monk>> frowns. "The dose was taken. We proceed."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Temple Arcade Submit]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Widgets X-Change Atonement [widget]
<<widget "temple-purity-pill">>
	/* args[0]: duration in days */
	<<set _days to _args[0] ?? 3>>
	<<set _durationHours to _days * 24 - 1>>
	<<if xchangePillProtectionActive()>>
		<<silently>><<xchange-effects _days []>><</silently>>
	<<elseif playerIsXChanged()>>
		<<if !pillIsPermanent()>>
			<<set $xchange.pill.duration to Math.max($xchange.pill.duration || 0, _durationHours)>>
			<<set $xchange.pill.countdown to Math.max($xchange.pill.countdown || 0, $xchange.pill.duration)>>
		<</if>>
		<<xchange-addeffect "innocence" _days>><<xchange-addeffect "cumcure" _days>>
		<<set $xchange.pill.effectsKnown to true>>
	<<else>>
		<<take-xchange _days "innocence" "cumcure">>
	<</if>>
	<<set $effectsmessage to 1>>
<</widget>>
